<title>JAPAN: Tokyo bourse says seeks to list Kosaido Printing.</title>
<headline>Tokyo bourse says seeks to list Kosaido Printing.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Tokyo Stock Exchange (TSE) said on Tuesday that it had applied to the Finance Ministry to list Kosaido Printing Co Ltd.</p>
<p>Kosaido Printing is likely to be listed on the TSE's second section on August 5. The firm plans to issue 2.8 million new shares, the TSE said.</p>
<p>Kosaido Printing is a printing firm and also develops computer software.</p>
</text>
